{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUIDE THE UNITED HUMANOID RACES TO VICTORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a space fleet commander, you take control of a powerful armada. Lead your ships to victory through skillful strategic action. Conquer planets to further enhance your strength. <br><strong> </strong><br><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN PLAYSTYLE\u200b</strong>  <br>Craft your own gameplay style by combining active and passive abilities. A multitude of builds is possible, each catering to individual tastes. Whether defensive or offensive, cunning or economical \u2014 there are no limits to the variety of playstyles. <br> <br><strong>CHALLENGE YOURSELF FOR GLORY AND HONOR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose mutators for your opponent to experience a special challenge. Increase your rewards and complete missions with special honors. For honor! <br> <br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, node-based strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Active and passive abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Individual builds and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutator and honor system for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challanges and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For casual and hardcore players</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687580?t=1761938954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687580/86b04521c78dc78e893ea7f579b94afa24a8ee71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761938954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687580/011d319c2d3431158d124250e903e07aba024750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761938954","capsul